I walk towards the bus stop.
It is evening time.
Many people are standing there.
My red BEST bus arrives.
I get into the bus.
There is not much crowd in the bus today.
A seat near the window is empty.
I sit there.
The conductor uncle comes to me.
I buy my ticket.
The bus moves forward swiftly.
Now I rest for a while.
I look out of the window.
Outside, the city lights are shining.
Mumbai looks very beautiful at night.
A cool breeze is coming in through the window.
I feel very calm.
I close my eyes for a moment.
After a short while, my stop comes.
I happily go home.
